  "instructions": [
    {
      "label": "How this works",
      "text": "Every box closed with + Full box in REC 7.4.3.1 / 7.4.3.2 appears here until its inspection is submitted. Weigh the tare, type the nett weight (it must equal the weight set in 7.4.3), then tick every check that is satisfactory. A box you do not touch is not recorded and stays on the list. The packing date is stamped automatically when you submit."
    }
  ],
